[
  {
    "slug": "daf-pubs",
    "title": "Dave Fiedler Publications",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>For better or worse, I write books and pamphlets. It's how I force my thinking into some sort of logical, coherent form. Well, at least I strive for logic, though of course the reader will be the final judge of that.</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Here are the books and lesser publications I've written, in the order they were published; the content of some is available for download in the next column, and pictures of all their covers are just below that:</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<ol>\n<li>**<em>Hindsight: Seventh-day Adventist Church History in Essays and Extracts</em>**[Lessons from Adventist History that I think every church member ought to know about.]</li>\n<li><p><em><strong>d'Sozo: Reversing the Worst Evil</strong></em> [The essential role of Medical Missionary Work in the Loud Cry and end time events.]</p>\n<p>» <em><strong>Identical</strong></em>(a condensed presentation in pocket book format)</p></li>\n</ol>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>»</em> In Spanish as, <strong><em>Idéntica</em></strong>\n3. _<strong>Tremble</strong>_[Lessons from the \"alpha apostasy\" when Medical Missionary Work went bad, and its continuing echoes in the church today.]</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<pre><code>» _**Modern Mysticism**_ (another pocket book condensation)\n</code></pre>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>4. <em><strong>Tactics: Lucifer's Rebellion and Christ's Response</strong></em> [Understanding the core issues of the great controversy, especially as illustrated in the work and influence of Dr. John Harvey Kellogg.]</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<pre><code>» _**Mission Brief**_ (yet _another_ pocket book condensation)\n</code></pre>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>5. <strong><em>Full Circle</em></strong> [A study of Lucifer's loss of faith, and its needed restoration in the lives of believers.]</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>»</em> In Spanish as, <strong><em>Regresando al Punto de Partida</em></strong></p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>»</em> In Portuguese as, <strong><em>Regressando ao Ponto de Partida</em></strong>\n6. <strong><em>Diasozo! The Ministry of Controversy and the Great Healing</em></strong>  [Identifying the remaining issues of the great controversy, and finding a rational approach to crossing them off the list!]\n7. <strong><em>For Such a Time</em></strong> [History and inspired instruction regarding the church's administrative authority and financial accountability.]\n8. _<strong>Officially Challenged</strong>_[The problematic history of \"Official Statements\" made by church administrators.]\n9. <strong><em>Directed by the Hand of the Lord</em></strong> [A charitable look at lessons to be learned from the church's \"Official Statements\" web site blunder.]</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>10. <strong><em>Circumstances and Common Sense</em></strong> [Historical analysis of the recurring agitation over tithe provides guidelines for many areas.]</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>Hindsight</em> is available as a PDF on this page, and in paperback directly from me. After being out of print for five years or so, a revised \"Second Edition\" of <em>d'Sozo</em> is again available in both paperback and e-book through <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D18JHPF4?binding=paperback&amp;ref=dbs_dp_rwt_sb_pc_tpbk\">Amazon</a>. <em>Tremble</em> and <em>Tactics</em> are both available from <a href=\"https://remnantpublications.com/catalogsearch/result/?q=fiedler\">Remnant Publications</a>. And <em>Diasozo!</em> is available in both paperback and e-book from <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D18JHPF4?binding=paperback&amp;ref=dbs_dp_rwt_sb_pc_tpbk\">Amazon</a>. The pocket book condensations, and Full Circle are all available for download here. The four \"Little Books\" with the blue swirly cover are available for download, and may also be purchased in hard copy from <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HGMXHG9R\">Amazon</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Anyone interested in hard copies of <em>Hindsight</em>, or ten or more hard copies of <em>d'Sozo</em> or <em>Diasozo!</em> (English or Spanish—see below) is encouraged to contact me directly. I should be able to save you some money.</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Español</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>d’Sozo: Revirtiendo el peor mal</em> (El auge y el papel esencial de la obra médica misionera adventista—disponible a través de <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D18JHPF4?binding=paperback&amp;ref=dbs_dp_rwt_sb_pc_tpbk\">Amazon</a>)</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>Diasozo! El Ministerio del Conflicto y La Gran Curación</em> (La centralidad de los “principios sozo” en toda la gran controversia—disponible a través de <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D18JHPF4?binding=paperback&amp;ref=dbs_dp_rwt_sb_pc_tpbk\">Amazon</a>)</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Româna</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p><em>d’Sozo: Reversarea celui mai mare rau</em> (Cre?terea ?i rolul esen?ial al misiunii medicale adventiste—disponibil pe dragmv@gmail.com)</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Of course, for anyone interested in helping translate any of the above into any known language... umm... that's my email at the bottom of the page.</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>Free  Downloads:</p>"
