  {
    "slug": "misc",
    "title": "General Miscellaneous",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>This is just a place to drop odds and ends that might be of interest. Haven't put a lot of thought or work into it yet, but I may, someday.</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>The Edwards' <em>Memoirs</em> are a fascinating read. Don't take them to be inspired. The odds that he was wrong on one thing or another are high. He was, after all, human. But I do enjoy his charitable spirit toward a lot of people whom I've read about, but that he <em>knew</em>\"in the flesh.\"</p>"
      },
      {
        "kind": "html",
        "html": "<p>When the EGW Collage was released by the White Estate, it was said to include every known picture of Ellen White. I haven't heard of any new ones being found, but it's not impossible.</p>"
      },
